---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="description" content="Squashr is a WordPress tournament manager built around the way squash clubs run draws, score matches and keep players informed." />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Squashr — Steven Mulvey Watters</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header class="site-header shell">
			<a class="wordmark" href="/">Steven Mulvey Watters</a>
			<nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/#work">Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="case-hero">
				<div class="case-hero-inner shell">
					<div class="hero-copy">
						<p class="eyebrow">Squashr · WordPress plugin</p>
						<h1>Tournament days,<br /><em>made simpler.</em></h1>
						<p class="lede">A tournament manager shaped around how squash clubs organise players, run draws, record results and keep everyone moving.</p>
						<dl class="project-meta">
							<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Product design & development</dd></div>
							<div><dt>Built with</dt><dd>WordPress · PHP · MySQL</dd></div>
							<div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Active development</dd></div>
						</dl>
					</div>
					<div class="hero-visual">
						<figure class="safari-frame hero-browser">
							<div class="safari-toolbar" aria-hidden="true"><span>Safari</span><span>Squashr organiser dashboard</span></div>
							<img src="/images/squashr/organiser-dashboard-desktop.jpg" alt="Squashr organiser dashboard showing tournament progress, players, matches and knockout completion" />
						</figure>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="manifesto shell section-grid" aria-labelledby="day-title">
				<p class="eyebrow">The idea</p>
				<div class="section-copy">
					<h2 id="day-title">One place from first entry to final result.</h2>
					<p>Club tournaments often depend on spreadsheets, paper draws and updates spread across several different places. That creates more work precisely when organisers are already busiest.</p>
					<p>Squashr brings the tournament together inside WordPress: players, divisions, groups, knockout draws, courts, scoring and the public view all share the same source of truth.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
				<div class="shell">
					<p class="eyebrow">Product principles</p>
					<h2 id="principles-title">Built around tournament day.</h2>
					<div class="principle-list">
						<article><span>01</span><h3>Clear for organisers</h3><p>Keep setup, players, draws, matches and courts together in one tournament workspace.</p></article>
						<article><span>02</span><h3>Simple at court-side</h3><p>Give scorers a focused mobile view with the current game, server and result history.</p></article>
						<article><span>03</span><h3>Visible to players</h3><p>Publish draws, matches, court views and results without requiring a WordPress login.</p></article>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="feature feature-draws" aria-labelledby="draws-title">
				<div class="feature-inner shell">
					<div class="feature-copy">
						<p class="eyebrow">Flexible competition</p>
						<h2 id="draws-title">Draws that fit the field.</h2>
						<p>Squashr supports round robins, seeded knockout draws, preliminary rounds, direct byes, Bronze matches and a separate Plate for eligible first-match losers.</p>
					</div>
					<figure class="iphone-frame match-browser-phone"><img src="/images/squashr/matches-mobile.jpg" alt="Squashr mobile match browser showing seeding pools and final divisions" /></figure>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="feature feature-live" aria-labelledby="live-title">
				<div class="feature-inner shell">
					<div class="feature-copy">
						<p class="eyebrow">Live at court-side</p>
						<h2 id="live-title">The match, clearly in hand.</h2>
						<p>The mobile scoring view keeps player names beside every score, makes the server unmistakable and preserves completed games and rally history as the match unfolds.</p>
					</div>
					<figure class="iphone-frame live-scoring-phone"><img src="/images/squashr/live-scoring-mobile.jpg" alt="Squashr live scoring during a match, with player names, current score, server and completed game" /></figure>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="public-view shell section-grid" aria-labelledby="public-title">
				<p class="eyebrow">For the whole club</p>
				<div class="section-copy">
					<h2 id="public-title">A public view that stays current.</h2>
					<p>Players and spectators can follow tournament information, draws, courts and live match summaries from a responsive public view. Direct links and QR access make it easy to open at the venue.</p>
					<figure class="safari-frame public-browser">
						<div class="safari-toolbar" aria-hidden="true"><span>Safari</span><span>Squashr public tournament view</span></div>
						<img src="/images/squashr/public-overview-desktop.jpg" alt="Squashr public tournament overview showing tournament totals and recent championship results" />
					</figure>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-title">
				<div class="shell platform-inner">
					<div>
						<p class="eyebrow">A practical foundation</p>
						<h2 id="platform-title">Built where clubs already publish.</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="platform-copy">
						<p>Squashr is a WordPress plugin rather than another disconnected tournament platform. Organisers manage the event in a familiar environment while players get a purpose-built public experience.</p>
						<ul><li>Multiple divisions and configurable formats</li><li>Automatic round robin and knockout generation</li><li>Responsive public and live-scoring views</li><li>Incremental development with stable behaviour</li></ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="closing shell">
				<img class="closing-logo" src="/images/squashr/squashr-logo-horizontal.svg" alt="Squashr" width="168" height="52" />
				<p class="eyebrow">Currently in active development</p>
				<h2>Less tournament admin.<br />More time for the squash.</h2>
				<a href="mailto:hello@mulveywatters.ie?subject=Squashr">Ask me about Squashr <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="footer"><div class="shell footer-inner"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to selected work</a><div class="footer-meta"><a href="mailto:hello@mulveywatters.ie">hello@mulveywatters.ie</a><span>Dublin, Ireland</span><span>© {year} Steven Mulvey Watters</span></div></div></footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap');
	:root { --paper:#f3f0e8; --ink:#11120f; --muted:#626159; --green:#064c34; --deep:#032b20; --mint:#dcebe3; --rule:rgba(17,18,15,.22); font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; color:var(--ink); background:var(--paper); font-synthesis:none; }
	* { box-sizing:border-box; }
	html { scroll-behavior:smooth; overflow-x:clip; }
	body { margin:0; background:var(--paper); overflow-x:clip; }
	a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; transition:opacity .2s ease; }
	a:hover { opacity:.68; }
	a:focus-visible { outline:2px solid currentColor; outline-offset:5px; }
	.shell { width:min(100% - 2rem,1180px); margin-inline:auto; }
	.site-header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding-block:1.35rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); }
	.wordmark, nav a, .eyebrow { font-size:.72rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
	nav { display:flex; gap:1.25rem; }
	nav a { letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:none; }
	h1, h2, h3 { font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif; font-weight:400; }
	.eyebrow { margin:0; }
	.case-hero { color:#fff; background:var(--green); overflow:hidden; }
	.case-hero-inner { min-height:50rem; padding-top:4.5rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
	.hero-copy { position:relative; z-index:2; }
	.hero-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom:2rem; }
	h1 { max-width:9em; margin:0; font-size:clamp(4.2rem,17vw,7.6rem); line-height:.84; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
	h1 em { font-weight:400; }
	.lede { max-width:35rem; margin:2rem 0 0; font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.55; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86); }
	.project-meta { display:grid; gap:1rem; margin:2.25rem 0 0; padding-top:1.25rem; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.42); }
	.project-meta div { display:grid; grid-template-columns:5rem 1fr; gap:1rem; }
	.project-meta dt { color:rgba(255,255,255,.6); font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
	.project-meta dd { margin:0; font-size:.82rem; }
	.hero-visual { height:27rem; margin:3rem -1rem 0; overflow:hidden; }
	.safari-frame { margin:0; overflow:hidden; background:#111923; border:.32rem solid #d8d9db; border-radius:1.15rem; box-shadow:0 2rem 6rem rgba(0,0,0,.28); }
	.safari-toolbar { height:2.65rem; display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; align-items:center; gap:1rem; padding:0 .9rem; color:#394047; background:#ececee; border-bottom:1px solid #c8c9cb; font-size:.64rem; font-weight:600; }
	.safari-toolbar span:last-child { min-width:0; padding:.48rem .85rem; overflow:hidden; color:#62676c; background:#fff; border:1px solid #d2d3d5; border-radius:.55rem; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
	.safari-frame img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
	.hero-browser { width:43rem; margin-left:2rem; }
	.section-grid { padding-block:5.5rem; }
	.section-grid > .eyebrow, .principles .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.5rem; color:var(--muted); }
	.section-copy h2, .principles h2, .feature h2, .platform h2, .closing h2 { margin:0; font-size:clamp(3.2rem,11vw,5.5rem); line-height:.92; letter-spacing:-.03em; }
	.section-copy > p { max-width:43rem; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.65; }
	.principles { padding-block:5.5rem; border-block:1px solid var(--rule); }
	.principles h2 { max-width:10em; }
	.principle-list { margin-top:3.5rem; }
	.principle-list article { padding-block:1.75rem; border-top:1px solid var(--rule); }
	.principle-list span { color:var(--muted); font-size:.72rem; }
	.principle-list h3 { margin:.8rem 0 .5rem; font-size:2.1rem; }
	.principle-list p { max-width:30rem; margin:0; line-height:1.55; color:var(--muted); }
	.feature { color:#fff; overflow:hidden; }
	.feature-draws { background:var(--deep); }
	.feature-live { background:#102f27; }
	.feature-inner { padding:4.5rem 0; }
	.feature-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.5rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,.62); }
	.feature h2 { max-width:8em; }
	.feature-copy > p:last-child { max-width:35rem; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
	.iphone-frame { margin:3rem auto -4.5rem; overflow:hidden; background:#050607; border:.62rem solid #090a0b; border-radius:3.45rem 3.45rem 0 0; box-shadow:0 2rem 5rem rgba(0,0,0,.34), inset 0 0 0 1px #4a4d50; }
	.iphone-frame img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
	.match-browser-phone { width:19rem; max-height:36rem; }
	.live-scoring-phone { width:19rem; max-height:39rem; }
	.public-browser { width:100%; margin-top:3rem; }
	.platform { color:#f3f0e8; background:#101310; }
	.platform-inner { padding-block:5.5rem; }
	.platform .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.5rem; color:#aeb0aa; }
	.platform h2 { max-width:8em; }
	.platform-copy { margin-top:3rem; }
	.platform-copy > p { max-width:38rem; font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.65; color:#c7cac3; }
	.platform-copy ul { list-style:none; margin:2rem 0 0; padding:0; border-top:1px solid #555a53; }
	.platform-copy li { padding:1rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #555a53; }
	.closing { padding-block:6rem; }
	.closing-logo { display:block; width:10.5rem; height:auto; margin-bottom:3rem; }
	.closing .eyebrow { margin-bottom:1.5rem; color:var(--muted); }
	.closing h2 { max-width:12em; }
	.closing > a { display:inline-block; margin-top:2.5rem; padding-bottom:.3rem; border-bottom:1px solid currentColor; font-weight:500; }
	.footer { color:#f4f1e9; background:#101310; }
	.footer-inner { padding-block:3rem 2rem; }
	.back-link { display:inline-block; padding-bottom:.25rem; border-bottom:1px solid #777b74; }
	.footer-meta { display:grid; gap:.7rem; margin-top:4rem; color:#bdc0b9; font-size:.78rem; }
	@media (min-width:960px) {
		.shell { width:min(100% - 5rem,1180px); }
		.site-header { padding-block:1.7rem; }
		.case-hero-inner { min-height:52rem; padding-top:7rem; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr; gap:5rem; }
		h1 { font-size:clamp(6rem,8.2vw,8.8rem); }
		.lede { font-size:1.2rem; }
		.project-meta { max-width:36rem; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1.5rem; }
		.project-meta div { display:block; }
		.project-meta dd { margin-top:.55rem; }
		.hero-visual { align-self:end; height:40rem; margin:0; overflow:visible; }
		.hero-browser { margin-top:6rem; margin-left:0; }
		.section-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:5rem; padding-block:8rem; overflow:hidden; }
		.section-grid > .eyebrow { margin-top:.45rem; }
		.section-copy { grid-column:2; }
		.section-copy h2, .principles h2, .feature h2, .platform h2, .closing h2 { font-size:clamp(4.7rem,6.2vw,6.8rem); }
		.principles { padding-block:8rem; }
		.principle-list { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:2.5rem; margin-top:5rem; }
		.principle-list article { min-height:17rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
		.principle-list p { margin-top:auto; }
		.feature-inner { min-height:54rem; padding:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; gap:5rem; align-items:center; }
		.feature-live .feature-copy { order:2; }
		.feature-copy > p:last-child { font-size:1.12rem; }
		.iphone-frame { align-self:end; width:24rem; margin:4rem auto -5rem; }
		.match-browser-phone { max-height:49rem; }
		.live-scoring-phone { max-height:50rem; }
		.public-browser { margin-top:3.5rem; }
		.platform-inner { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:5rem; padding-block:8rem; }
		.platform-copy { margin-top:0; }
		.closing { padding-block:9rem; }
		.footer-inner { padding-block:4rem 2.5rem; }
		.footer-meta { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto; }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference) {
		@keyframes reveal { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px); } to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }
		.hero-copy > *, .hero-visual { animation:reveal .65s ease both; }
		.hero-visual { animation-delay:.12s; }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { html { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
</style>
